# Ad-hoc screenshot output. Added 2026-07-31.
# `screenshots/` already held 15 captures with NO ignore rule. It is excluded from the
# shipped artifact only because build-dist.js uses an allowlist (DIRS) that happens not
# to name it — that is luck, not a decision, and it does not stop a capture being
# COMMITTED. The live risk is a run pointed at app.crowagent.ai with a real logged-in
# account: real tenants, real contract names, real values, committed to a public repo.
# Marketing captures belong in Assets/shots/, which is normalised and pixel-verified.
screenshots/

# Local screenshot scratch from .dev-tools/shoot-page.cjs, never shipped
.shots-tmp/

# Audit and comparison captures written into the DEPLOY ROOT. Added 2026-08-04 (R-01).
#
# `audit-screenshots/` (3 files, 5.6 MB) and the three `pre26-*.png` full-page
# captures (4.2 MB) were both sitting untracked at the repo root. Measured before
# writing this rule rather than assumed:
#
#   audit-screenshots/  NOT shipped. build-dist.js copies whole directories from an
#                       allowlist (DIRS) which does not name it — the same luck the
#                       `screenshots/` note above records, not a decision.
#   pre26-*.png         SHIPPED. Root files are copied by EXTENSION (ROOT_EXTS), and
#                       `.png` is on that list, so all three landed in dist/ and would
#                       have been published on the next deploy. Verified: dist/ holds
#                       pre26-full.png (2.59 MB), pre26-home.png and pre26-hero.png
#                       (0.79 MB each).
#
# Neither is live today — https://crowagent.ai/pre26-home.png and
# /audit-screenshots/screenshot-homepage.png both return 404 — because Cloudflare Pages
# builds from a git clone, so an untracked file is not in the build at all. That is
# exactly why the ignore rule is the structural fix: it keeps them untracked, and
# untracked is unpublishable. build-dist.js additionally refuses the three pre26 files
# by name, so a local dist/ matches production too.
audit-screenshots/
pre26-*.png

# Scratch probe written while diagnosing a render gate. Cannot ship (`.mjs` is not in
# build-dist.js's ROOT_EXTS) but has no business being committed either.
probe.mjs

